= Biography

== Education

Ph.D., *Nanyang Technological University* (NTU), Singapore, Aug 2013 - Feb 2018

- School of Electrical and Electronic Engineering
- Advisor: Prof. Lihua Xie
- Thesis: Control over Networks with Fading Communication Channels

M.Sc., *Harbin Institute of Technology* (HIT), China, Sep 2011 - Jul 2013

- School of Astronautics, Control Science and Engineering
- Advisor: Prof. Qinglei Hu

B.S., *Harbin Institute of Technology* (HIT), China, Sep 2007 - Jul 2011

- School of Astronautics, Detection, Guidance and Control Technology

== Work Experience

- Professor and Doctoral Supervisor, Hangzhou International Innovation Institute, Beihang University, China, Sep 2026 - Present
- Professor and Doctoral Supervisor, School of Future Technology, Shanghai University, China, Nov 2022 - Aug 2026
- Postdoctoral Researcher, Institute of Mechanical Engineering (IGM), EPFL, Switzerland, Jul 2019 - Oct 2022. Advisor: Prof. Giancarlo Ferrari-Trecate
- Research Associate / Research Fellow, School of Electrical and Electronic Engineering, NTU, Singapore, Aug 2017 - Jul 2019. Advisors: Prof. Lihua Xie and Prof. Yilin Mo

